    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU:</h1><p><br><br><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/82341777e64511b3db3e5fb130d70756.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/82341777e64511b3db3e5fb130d70756.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/82341777e64511b3db3e5fb130d70756.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a memorable experience with a relaxing LoFi soundtrack and unique visuals that will leave you extremely satisfied.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/939db7cb4d0cf053589d44e0a6269c4e.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/939db7cb4d0cf053589d44e0a6269c4e.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/939db7cb4d0cf053589d44e0a6269c4e.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are responsible for constructing the runway for the airplane to take off. To do this, fit the runway cubes correctly into the indicated positions on the platform.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/b0ef9daa4f59bf5ccce755fffdc08033.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/b0ef9daa4f59bf5ccce755fffdc08033.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/b0ef9daa4f59bf5ccce755fffdc08033.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- 40 levels;<br>- Original soundtrack;<br>- Satisfying puzzles;<br>- Low poly visuals;<br>- Play with the mouse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/56ebb2ee327a9fa2720ceaa67bb4a36d.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/56ebb2ee327a9fa2720ceaa67bb4a36d.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/56ebb2ee327a9fa2720ceaa67bb4a36d.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/82341777e64511b3db3e5fb130d70756.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/82341777e64511b3db3e5fb130d70756.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/82341777e64511b3db3e5fb130d70756.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a memorable experience with a relaxing LoFi soundtrack and unique visuals that will leave you extremely satisfied.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/939db7cb4d0cf053589d44e0a6269c4e.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/939db7cb4d0cf053589d44e0a6269c4e.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/939db7cb4d0cf053589d44e0a6269c4e.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are responsible for constructing the runway for the airplane to take off. To do this, fit the runway cubes correctly into the indicated positions on the platform.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/b0ef9daa4f59bf5ccce755fffdc08033.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/b0ef9daa4f59bf5ccce755fffdc08033.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/b0ef9daa4f59bf5ccce755fffdc08033.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- 40 levels;<br>- Original soundtrack;<br>- Satisfying puzzles;<br>- Low poly visuals;<br>- Play with the mouse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/56ebb2ee327a9fa2720ceaa67bb4a36d.poster.avif?t=1721329347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/56ebb2ee327a9fa2720ceaa67bb4a36d.webm?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402100/extras/56ebb2ee327a9fa2720ceaa67bb4a36d.mp4?t=1721329347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
